{
  "conversation_lines": [
    {
      "turn_number": 1,
      "time": "2152-05-04 18:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Hello, Mr. ___. I’m Dr. ___. You’re here because you’ve been feeling more tired and confused lately. We’re going to figure out what’s going on."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 2,
      "time": "2152-05-04 18:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yes, I’ve been so sleepy. My family said I wasn’t making sense. I didn’t feel like eating either."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 3,
      "time": "2152-05-04 18:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We ran some tests. Your urine showed an infection with a bacteria called Enterococcus. It’s resistant to some antibiotics, but sensitive to vancomycin."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 4,
      "time": "2152-05-04 18:06:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Is that why I’ve been so out of it? The confusion?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 5,
      "time": "2152-05-04 18:08:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Partly. The infection, along with high calcium from your myeloma, likely contributed. We’ve started IV fluids and will begin vancomycin to treat the infection."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 6,
      "time": "2152-05-04 18:10:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay. And the calcium? Is that getting better?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 7,
      "time": "2152-05-04 18:12:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re treating it with fluids, a medication called pamidronate, and steroids. Your calcium has come down a bit, but it’s still high."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 8,
      "time": "2152-05-05 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Good morning. Your chest X-ray shows no pneumonia, but there’s some scarring and mild fluid around the lungs. We’re watching your breathing."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 9,
      "time": "2152-05-05 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’ve been coughing a little. Is it from the myeloma?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 10,
      "time": "2152-05-05 09:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "The cough may be from old scarring or mild congestion. We don’t see active infection, but we’ll keep monitoring."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 11,
      "time": "2152-05-06 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your blood work shows your kidney function is worsening. This is likely due to the high calcium and your myeloma progression."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 12,
      "time": "2152-05-06 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "My legs feel weak. Is that from the kidneys?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 13,
      "time": "2152-05-06 10:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Weakness can come from several things—kidney issues, high calcium, or the myeloma itself. We’re doing everything we can to support you."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 14,
      "time": "2152-05-07 08:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re concerned you might be aspirating—food or liquid going into your lungs—because of your swallowing issues."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 15,
      "time": "2152-05-07 08:32:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I don’t feel like I’m choking. Why would that happen?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 16,
      "time": "2152-05-07 08:34:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Sometimes, especially with confusion or weakness, the reflex isn’t strong. We’ll do a swallowing study to check."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 17,
      "time": "2152-05-09 11:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "The swallowing study confirmed it. You’re silently aspirating thin liquids. That means you’re not coughing, but fluid is going into your lungs."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 18,
      "time": "2152-05-09 11:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "So I can’t drink water?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 19,
      "time": "2152-05-09 11:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Not right now. We’ll thicken your liquids and may need to stop oral intake to protect your lungs."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 20,
      "time": "2152-05-09 12:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We placed a PICC line so we can give antibiotics and fluids safely over the next few days."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 21,
      "time": "2152-05-09 12:32:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Will that help me get stronger?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 22,
      "time": "2152-05-09 12:34:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "It helps deliver treatment, but your myeloma is progressing. Your IgG level is very high, and we see plasma cells in your blood."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 23,
      "time": "2152-05-10 08:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "The CT scan of your head shows no stroke or bleed. But your sinuses are inflamed, which could add to your fatigue."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 24,
      "time": "2152-05-10 08:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "My head doesn’t hurt. Is it serious?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 25,
      "time": "2152-05-10 08:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Not life-threatening, but it’s one more thing your body is fighting. We’ll treat it if needed, but we’re focusing on comfort now."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 26,
      "time": "2152-05-10 15:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your breathing is more labored. The chest CT shows possible aspiration pneumonia. We’re starting antibiotics just in case."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 27,
      "time": "2152-05-10 15:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I feel like I can’t catch my breath."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 28,
      "time": "2152-05-10 15:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re giving oxygen and nebulizers. But because of your overall condition, we need to talk about goals of care."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 29,
      "time": "2152-05-11 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your family and I spoke. We agree that comfort is the priority now. We’ll stop aggressive treatments and focus on keeping you pain-free."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 30,
      "time": "2152-05-11 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I just want to be peaceful. No more needles if possible."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 31,
      "time": "2152-05-11 10:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll minimize interventions. You’ll have morphine available for comfort, and your family can stay with you."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 32,
      "time": "2152-05-12 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re doing well with comfort care. Your breathing is slower, but you’re not in distress."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 33,
      "time": "2152-05-12 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thank you… for being honest."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 34,
      "time": "2152-05-13 08:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your mouth has some thrush, so we’re giving fluconazole. It’s common when the body is weak."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 35,
      "time": "2152-05-13 08:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "It burns a little when I try to swallow."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 36,
      "time": "2152-05-13 08:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We know. That’s why we’re not pushing food or drink. We’re using swabs to keep your mouth moist."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 37,
      "time": "2152-05-14 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "The latest X-ray shows your lungs are stable. You’re still comfortable, and your family is here with you."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 38,
      "time": "2152-05-14 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "That’s good. I want them close."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 39,
      "time": "2152-05-15 07:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your breathing has slowed further. You’re peaceful, and we’re here with you every step."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 40,
      "time": "2152-05-15 07:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Tell my son… I love him."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 41,
      "time": "2152-05-15 07:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I will. He’s right here, holding your hand."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 42,
      "time": "2152-05-16 06:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re very quiet today. We’re keeping you comfortable with medication. Your family is by your side."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 43,
      "time": "2152-05-16 06:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "…"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 44,
      "time": "2152-05-17 05:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re still breathing gently. We’ve dimmed the lights and let your family bring in music you like."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 45,
      "time": "2152-05-17 05:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "…"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 46,
      "time": "2152-05-18 04:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re very close to the end. We’re not leaving you. Your family is saying their goodbyes."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 47,
      "time": "2152-05-18 04:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "…"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 48,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your breathing has stopped. You passed peacefully, surrounded by your family. Thank you for letting us care for you."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 49,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:01:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will notify the team and begin the process to honor your wishes."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 50,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your family is grieving, but they’re grateful for the time they had with you at the end."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 51,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:03:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will ensure everything is handled with dignity and care."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 52,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You were brave and kind throughout this journey."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 53,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:05:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will miss you, Mr. ___."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 54,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:06:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "The palliative care team will support your family in the coming days."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 55,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:07:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Thank you for trusting us with your care."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 56,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:08:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will document everything with respect and compassion."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 57,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:09:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your legacy of strength will stay with us."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 58,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:10:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will ensure your story is honored in our records."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 59,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:11:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your family has asked to spend a little more time with you."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 60,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:12:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will give them privacy and support as they say goodbye."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 61,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:13:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "The chaplain is here if they need spiritual support."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 62,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:14:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will assist with all next steps when they’re ready."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 63,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:15:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your journey has ended with dignity and love."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 64,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:16:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will never forget the courage you showed."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 65,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:17:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Rest now, Mr. ___. You are at peace."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 66,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:18:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will take care of everything from here."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 67,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:19:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your family’s love surrounded you until the very end."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 68,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:20:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will support them as they begin to heal."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 69,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:21:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You were not alone. You were deeply loved."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 70,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:22:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will carry your memory with us."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 71,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:23:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Thank you for allowing us to be part of your story."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 72,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:24:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your peace is now complete."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 73,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:25:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will ensure your final wishes are honored."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 74,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:26:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your family will receive all the support they need."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 75,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:27:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You are now free from pain and suffering."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 76,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:28:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will remember you with respect and gratitude."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 77,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:29:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your journey has come to a gentle close."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 78,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will be here for your family every step of the way."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 79,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:31:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You were surrounded by love until your last breath."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 80,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:32:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will honor your life and legacy."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 81,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:33:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Rest in peace, Mr. ___."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 82,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:34:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your story matters."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 83,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:35:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will never forget you."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 84,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:36:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Thank you for the privilege of caring for you."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 85,
      "time": "2152-05-18 23:37:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You are at peace now."
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "admission_start": "2152-05-04 17:52:00",
    "admission_end": "2152-05-19 00:00:00",
    "summary_paragraph": "Mr. ___, a patient with end-stage multiple myeloma, COPD, CHF, and a neobladder, was admitted with altered mental status and somnolence. Evaluation revealed an Enterococcus urinary tract infection, hypercalcemia, and silent aspiration confirmed by videofluoroscopy. Despite treatment with vancomycin, pamidronate, and supportive care, his condition deteriorated due to progressive myeloma, worsening renal function, and aspiration pneumonia. A decision was made to transition to comfort-focused care, and he passed peacefully surrounded by family. The hospital course was marked by multidisciplinary support, including palliative care, speech and swallow evaluation, and infection management.",
    "problems": [
      "Urinary tract infection, site not specified",
      "Encephalopathy, unspecified",
      "Pneumonitis due to inhalation of food or vomitus",
      "Multiple myeloma, without mention of having achieved remission",
      "Chronic systolic heart failure",
      "Candidiasis of mouth",
      "Streptococcus infection in conditions classified elsewhere and of unspecified site, streptococcus, group D [Enterococcus]",
      "Myelodysplastic syndrome, unspecified",
      "Hypertensive chronic kidney disease, unspecified, with chronic kidney disease stage I through stage IV, or unspecified",
      "Chronic kidney disease, Stage III (moderate)",
      "Congestive heart failure, unspecified",
      "Abdominal aneurysm without mention of rupture",
      "Depressive disorder, not elsewhere classified",
      "Hypoxemia",
      "Thrombocytopenia, unspecified",
      "Hypercalcemia",
      "Chronic airway obstruction, not elsewhere classified",
      "Bladder replaced by other means",
      "Personal history of malignant neoplasm of bladder",
      "Encounter for palliative care",
      "Do not resuscitate status"
    ]
  }
}
